KZ3 patch 4014 (stage 3b, ENHANCEMENT, opt-in): the editor behind the in-game "Edit custom layout" page.
pad_remap_ui.h (new, pure): the page's rows (the game's actions, one per game button), bind / swap on conflict /
clear / reset-to-preset on the custom table of 4013, the Start button can never be left unbound, and the text
commands "kb:pm ..." (pmu_command, dispatched from pad_kb_ui_command next to padmap). cellPad.c: pad_map_edit_poll
runs the capture of the next pad button on the raw host reports before the remap, keeps pad and keys from the game
while it runs and until everything is released, saves keybinds.ini after a change (every change makes the layout
Custom), KZ3_PM_TEST_BTN=<ps3 button> answers a waiting capture (Xvfb runs), the pad family comes from port 0.
Host test: tools/net/test_pad_remap_ui.c. Page: port/net/kz3_padpage.h.

